import{_ as i,o as n,c as o,a2 as t}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const u=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 857 | Transcended Ones and History | The Historical Roots of Civilizational Regression","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 857 | Transcended Ones and History | The Historical Roots of Civilizational Regression","no":857,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Civilizational Regression","Historical Roots","Reincarnation Harvest","Class Solidification"],"related":["71-Pre-Anchor Era","739-Civilizational-Regression Causal Chain","856-Transcended-One View of History Overview","859-Transcended-One Historical Responsibility"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0857_模块4-超脱者与历史-文明倒退根源.md","filePath":"en/0857_模块4-超脱者与历史-文明倒退根源.md"}'),a={name:"en/0857_模块4-超脱者与历史-文明倒退根源.md"};function s(r,e,l,d,h,g){return n(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[t('<h1 id="entry-857-transcended-ones-and-history-the-historical-roots-of-civilizational-regression" tabindex="-1">Entry 857 | Transcended Ones and History | The Historical Roots of Civilizational Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-857-transcended-ones-and-history-the-historical-roots-of-civilizational-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 857 | Transcended Ones and History | The Historical Roots of Civilizational Regression&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 71, 739, 856, 859</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-does-civilization-walk-itself-back-to-barbarism" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why does civilization walk itself back to barbarism <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-does-civilization-walk-itself-back-to-barbarism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why does civilization walk itself back to barbarism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview&#39;s most uncanny phenomenon is civilization&#39;s &quot;pendulum&quot; — just flourished, yet walks itself back to barbarism. Era cycles, reincarnation harvest, strong ones contending for hegemony, all are beaten back to the origin point. The very reason Heng Yuan Zhou must set a &quot;perpetual mechanism to eliminate civilizational regression&quot; is because it deeply knows: <strong>regression is not accidental disaster, it has identifiable historical roots.</strong> This entry explains: where civilizational regression actually comes from, and on what basis the transcended one may predict and block it.</p><p>Six top-level axioms centrally diagnose <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong>&#39;s post-destruction pathology: regression is essentially predation rearing its head; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires finding the causal chain and cutting it; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> is what regression would destroy; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> is the direction regression would reverse; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the pathology analysis be self-consistent.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-regression-s-four-historical-roots" tabindex="-1">I. Regression&#39;s Four Historical Roots <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-regression-s-four-historical-roots" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Regression&#39;s Four Historical Roots&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Benchmarking Document 71 Pre-Anchor Era and entry 739 Civilizational-Regression Causal Chain, civilizational regression has four intertwined roots:</p><ol><li><strong>The strong re-monopolize</strong>: one generation of strong ones finally opened knowledge; the next generation of strong ones takes it back into private vaults; knowledge monopoly rebuilds; class re-solidifies.</li><li><strong>Predation restoration</strong>: Myriad Ranks have just tasted symbiosis&#39; benefits; old predatory rhetoric (&quot;the strong should take more,&quot; &quot;harvest fortune&quot;) is dug up again; short-cut inner demons spread again.</li><li><strong>Causal accounts unsettled</strong>: causality owed by old-era predation has not been settled; it flows back in new forms, creating new suffering.</li><li><strong>Supervision laxity</strong>: once supervision slackens, the strong start bypassing rules, hollowing out institutions bit by bit.</li></ol><p>The four often flare together: monopoly paves the way for predation, predation creates enmity, enmity is covered by lax supervision, ultimately civilization one day suddenly crashes back to barbarism.</p><h2 id="ii-regression-s-early-signals" tabindex="-1">II. Regression&#39;s Early Signals <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-regression-s-early-signals" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Regression&#39;s Early Signals&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The transcended one&#39;s historical contribution is to turn &quot;regression&quot; from &quot;sudden disaster&quot; into &quot;an early-warning process.&quot; It identifies early signals:</p><ul><li>Signs that <strong>knowledge is again held by a few</strong>;</li><li>Public-opinion winds that <strong>&quot;old-era strong-ones&#39; stories&quot; are again being romanticized</strong>;</li><li><strong>Supervision-data anomalies</strong>: complaints received by the Anchor Supervisory Committee, predatory苗头 in Alaya records increasing;</li><li><strong>Class flow stagnation</strong>: the bottom no longer moves upward, solidification begins.</li></ul><p>Once these signals appear, the civilizational-correction post immediately intervenes — <strong>act while regression can still be reversed.</strong></p><h2 id="iii-why-the-pendulum-theory-is-wrong" tabindex="-1">III. Why the &quot;Pendulum Theory&quot; Is Wrong <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-why-the-pendulum-theory-is-wrong" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Why the &quot;Pendulum Theory&quot; Is Wrong&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview comforts itself: &quot;the world&#39;s great trend, long-divided must reunite, long-reunited must divide&quot; — treating regression as inevitable natural law. Heng Yuan Zhou firmly opposes:</p><ul><li>Regression is not physical law, but <strong>institutional failure</strong> — it has a cause, therefore may be blocked;</li><li>Saying &quot;inevitable&quot; is finding an excuse for irresponsibility;</li><li>The entire meaning of the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization is to prove <strong>progress may be irreversible.</strong></li></ul><p>This is entry 856&#39;s &quot;history has direction&quot; — direction is maintained by people, not swung by a pendulum itself.</p><h2 id="iv-regression-and-reincarnation-harvest" tabindex="-1">IV. Regression and Reincarnation Harvest <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-regression-and-reincarnation-harvest" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Regression and Reincarnation Harvest&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old worldview has a particularly vile regression form: <strong>reincarnation harvest</strong> — some existence pens up Myriad Ranks and harvests fortune generation after generation. Entry 775 already criticized Zheng-Zha-style reincarnation harvest. Heng Yuan Zhou identifies it as regression&#39;s extreme form: it is not natural decay, but man-made, parasitic regression. Blocking it requires identifying &quot;who is penning up Myriad Ranks&quot; and removing the parasite from the circulation.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: identify regression roots, avoiding civilization&#39;s enormous waste of rebuilding from zero again and again</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: regression&#39;s essence is predation rearing its head; blocking regression is continuous anti-predation</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo worldview defaults to pendulum cycle and reincarnation harvest; Heng Yuan Zhou diagnoses regression as blockable pathology</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: regression early warning protects all Myriad-Rank beings, especially the bottom most easily sacrificed</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: regression signals, pathology analysis, and blocking mechanism all public and supervisable</li></ul><h2 id="supplement-regression-monitoring-s-weight" tabindex="-1">Supplement: Regression Monitoring&#39;s Weight <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplement-regression-monitoring-s-weight" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplement: Regression Monitoring&#39;s Weight&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Identifying regression roots ultimately lands on monitoring. Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision continuously watches: whether knowledge is again held by a few, whether predatory rhetoric rises again, whether supervision data is anomalous. The transcended one&#39;s work identifying and blocking these early signals is counted into civilizational weight by its effect of &quot;strangling regression in the cradle.&quot; This set of monitoring lets the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm for the first time own the ability &quot;not to repeat the same mistakes&quot; — regression is no longer fate, but pathology that is diagnosed, early-warned, and blocked. When Myriad Ranks no longer believe the fatalism of &quot;long-divided must reunite,&quot; civilization holds the steering wheel in its own hands.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilizational regression is not fate, it is disease. Its roots are the strong re-monopolizing, predation restoration, unsettled causal accounts, and supervision laxity — four flaring together, beating prosperity back to barbarism. The transcended one&#39;s historical contribution lies in diagnosing this disease from &quot;sudden disaster&quot; into &quot;pathology that is early-warnable and blockable,&quot; and acting while it can still be reversed. When Myriad Ranks no longer believe the fatalism of &quot;long-divided must reunite&quot; but believe &quot;progress may be maintained,&quot; civilization for the first time holds the steering wheel in its own hands.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/71-前锚点时代.html">Entry 71 · Pre-Anchor Era</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/739_模块4-挂机养老批判-文明倒退因果链.html">Entry 739 · Civilizational-Regression Causal Chain</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/856_模块4-超脱者与历史-总论.html">Entry 856 · Transcended-One View of History Overview</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/859_模块4-超脱者与历史-超脱者的历史责任.html">Entry 859 · Transcended-One Historical Responsibility</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const y=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{u as __pageData,y as default};
